{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21282","headline":"顺宗至德大圣大安孝皇帝挽歌词三首 二 · 元稹","name":"顺宗至德大圣大安孝皇帝挽歌词三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"前春文祖庙，大舜嗣尧登。\n及此踰年感，还因是月崩。\n寿缘追孝促，业在继明兴。\n俭诏同今古，山川绕灞陵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21282.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21282","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}